msgid "Profile"
msgstr "Profil"

msgid "Privacy"
msgstr "Privasi"

msgid "Permissions"
msgstr "Izin"

msgid "Important dates"
msgstr "Tanggal penting"

msgid "Full name"
msgstr "Nama lengkap"

msgid "Institution"
msgstr "Institusi"

msgid "School, university, or organisation. Optional."
msgstr "Sekolah, universitas, atau lembaga. Opsional."

msgid "I am a"
msgstr "Saya seorang"

msgid "Choose your role"
msgstr "Pilih peran Anda"

msgid "Interface language"
msgstr "Bahasa antarmuka"

msgid "I have read and agree to the privacy policy."
msgstr "Saya sudah membaca dan menyetujui kebijakan privasi."

msgid "Agree to the privacy policy to create an account."
msgstr "Setujui kebijakan privasi untuk membuat akun."

msgid "Password"
msgstr "Kata sandi"

msgid "The password is incorrect."
msgstr "Kata sandi salah."

msgid "Student"
msgstr "Pelajar"

msgid "Teacher"
msgstr "Guru"

msgid "Researcher"
msgstr "Peneliti"

msgid "General public"
msgstr "Umum"

msgid "email address"
msgstr "alamat email"

msgid "full name"
msgstr "nama lengkap"

msgid "institution"
msgstr "institusi"

msgid "role"
msgstr "peran"

msgid "preferred language"
msgstr "bahasa pilihan"

msgid "privacy policy accepted at"
msgstr "waktu persetujuan kebijakan privasi"

msgid "privacy policy version"
msgstr "versi kebijakan privasi"

msgid "Your profile has been saved."
msgstr "Profil Anda sudah disimpan."

msgid "Your account and all of its data have been deleted."
msgstr "Akun Anda beserta seluruh datanya sudah dihapus."

msgid "Simple"
msgstr "Sederhana"

msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "Lanjutan"

#, python-format
msgid "CV F1 %(f1)s (%(ref)s)"
msgstr "F1 CV %(f1)s (%(ref)s)"

#, python-format
msgid "test F1 %(f1)s (%(ref)s)"
msgstr "F1 uji %(f1)s (%(ref)s)"

msgid "test F1 –"
msgstr "F1 uji –"

msgid "best in the thesis"
msgstr "terbaik menurut tesis"

msgid "coming soon"
msgstr "segera hadir"

msgid "M2 · Word vector"
msgstr "M2 · Word vector"

msgid "M1 · Word vector"
msgstr "M1 · Word vector"

msgid "M2 · Lexicon (coming soon)"
msgstr "M2 · Leksikon (segera hadir)"

msgid "M1 · Lexicon (coming soon)"
msgstr "M1 · Leksikon (segera hadir)"

msgid "Satua text"
msgstr "Teks satua"

msgid "Balinese text in Latin script. End every sentence with a full stop."
msgstr ""
"Teks berbahasa Bali dalam huruf Latin. Akhiri setiap kalimat dengan titik."

msgid "What to analyse"
msgstr "Yang ingin dianalisis"

msgid "(i) Character identification model"
msgstr "(i) Model identifikasi tokoh"

msgid "(ii) Alias clustering method"
msgstr "(ii) Metode pengelompokan nama lain (alias)"

msgid "(ii) Similarity threshold"
msgstr "(ii) Ambang kemiripan"

msgid "Between 0.50 and 1.00. The thesis uses 0.85."
msgstr "Antara 0,50 dan 1,00. Tesis memakai 0,85."

msgid "(iii) Role classification model"
msgstr "(iii) Model klasifikasi peran"

#, python-format
msgid "CV F1 %(f1)s"
msgstr "F1 CV %(f1)s"

#, python-format
msgid "test F1 %(f1)s"
msgstr "F1 uji %(f1)s"

msgid "This model is not available yet. Choose another model."
msgstr "Model ini belum tersedia. Pilih model lain."

msgid "The analysis could not be completed. Your text has not been lost."
msgstr "Analisis tidak dapat diselesaikan. Teks Anda tidak hilang."

msgid ""
"The text could not be prepared for analysis. Check that it is a Balinese "
"story."
msgstr ""
"Teks tidak dapat disiapkan untuk dianalisis. Periksa apakah teks berupa "
"satua berbahasa Bali."

msgid ""
"Character identification failed because the model did not respond. Your text "
"has not been lost."
msgstr ""
"Identifikasi tokoh gagal karena model tidak merespons. Teks Anda tidak "
"hilang."

msgid ""
"Grouping the characters' other names failed. Your text has not been lost."
msgstr "Pengelompokan nama lain tokoh gagal. Teks Anda tidak hilang."

msgid ""
"Role classification failed because the model did not respond. Your text has "
"not been lost."
msgstr ""
"Klasifikasi peran gagal karena model tidak merespons. Teks Anda tidak hilang."

msgid ""
"The role classification model is not available right now. Character "
"identification and grouping still work."
msgstr ""
"Model klasifikasi peran sedang tidak tersedia. Identifikasi dan "
"pengelompokan tokoh tetap berjalan."

msgid ""
"The word embedding needed by this model is not available right now. Try "
"another model or try again later."
msgstr ""
"Word embedding yang dibutuhkan model ini sedang tidak tersedia. Pilih model "
"lain atau coba lagi nanti."

msgid "Word vector"
msgstr "Word vector"

msgid "Lexicon"
msgstr "Leksikon"

msgid "M2: optimal configuration trained on all training data"
msgstr "M2: konfigurasi optimal yang dilatih dengan seluruh data latih"

msgid "M1: optimal configuration trained on the best cross-validation fold"
msgstr ""
"M1: konfigurasi optimal yang dilatih pada fold cross-validation terbaik"

msgid "Full pipeline: identification, grouping and roles"
msgstr "Pipeline lengkap: identifikasi, pengelompokan, dan peran"

msgid "Character identification only"
msgstr "Identifikasi tokoh saja"

msgid "Identification and name grouping"
msgstr "Identifikasi dan pengelompokan nama"

msgid "Role classification"
msgstr "Klasifikasi peran"

msgid ""
"No characters were recognised. Check that the text is written in Balinese."
msgstr "Tidak ada tokoh yang dikenali. Periksa apakah teks berbahasa Bali."

msgid "Enter the text of a satua to analyse."
msgstr "Masukkan teks satua yang ingin dianalisis."

#, python-format
msgid "The text is too long. Enter at most %(limit)s characters."
msgstr "Teks terlalu panjang. Masukkan paling banyak %(limit)s karakter."

msgid ""
"The text appears to use Balinese script. Enter the satua in Latin script; "
"Balinese script support is coming soon."
msgstr ""
"Teks tampaknya memakai aksara Bali. Masukkan satua dalam huruf Latin; "
"dukungan aksara Bali segera hadir."

msgid "The text has no sentences. End every sentence with a full stop (.)."
msgstr "Teks tidak memiliki kalimat. Akhiri setiap kalimat dengan titik (.)."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"The text has fewer than %(n)s sentences, the minimum used in the thesis. "
"Results may be less reliable."
msgstr ""
"Teks memiliki kurang dari %(n)s kalimat, batas minimum pada tesis. Hasil "
"bisa kurang andal."

msgid "Indonesian"
msgstr "Indonesia"

msgid "English"
msgstr "Inggris"

#, python-format
msgid "Hello %(name)s,"
msgstr "Halo %(name)s,"

msgid "Hello,"
msgstr "Halo,"

msgid "Warm regards,"
msgstr "Salam hangat,"

msgid "The PrasiBali.ai team"
msgstr "Tim PrasiBali.ai"

msgid ""
"This email was sent automatically by PrasiBali.ai. Please do not reply to it."
msgstr ""
"Email ini dikirim otomatis oleh PrasiBali.ai. Mohon tidak membalas email ini."

msgid ""
"We received a request to confirm this email address for your PrasiBali.ai "
"account."
msgstr ""
"Kami menerima permintaan untuk mengonfirmasi alamat email ini bagi akun "
"PrasiBali.ai Anda."

msgid "Your verification code:"
msgstr "Kode verifikasi Anda:"

msgid "Enter this code in the open browser window."
msgstr "Masukkan kode ini di jendela browser yang sedang terbuka."

msgid "Open the link below, then press the Confirm button:"
msgstr "Buka tautan berikut, lalu tekan tombol Konfirmasi:"

#, python-format
msgid "This link is valid for %(days)s day."
msgid_plural "This link is valid for %(days)s days."
msgstr[0] "Tautan ini berlaku selama %(days)s hari."

msgid "Did not make this request? You can safely ignore this email."
msgstr "Tidak merasa meminta konfirmasi ini? Abaikan saja email ini."

msgid ""
"Thank you for signing up for PrasiBali.ai, a workspace for analysing the "
"characters in Balinese satua."
msgstr ""
"Terima kasih telah mendaftar di PrasiBali.ai, ruang kerja untuk menganalisis "
"tokoh dalam satua Bali."

msgid "One more step: confirm your email address to activate your account."
msgstr ""
"Tinggal satu langkah lagi: konfirmasi alamat email Anda untuk mengaktifkan "
"akun."

msgid "Enter this code in the browser window you used to sign up."
msgstr "Masukkan kode ini di jendela browser yang Anda pakai untuk mendaftar."

msgid ""
"Once your account is active, sign in to recognise characters, group their "
"other names, and see whether they are protagonists or antagonists."
msgstr ""
"Setelah akun aktif, masuk untuk mengenali tokoh, menyatukan nama lain, dan "
"melihat peran protagonis atau antagonis dalam satua."

msgid ""
"Did not sign up for PrasiBali.ai? You can safely ignore this email. The "
"account will not be activated without confirmation."
msgstr ""
"Tidak merasa mendaftar di PrasiBali.ai? Abaikan saja email ini. Akun tidak "
"akan aktif tanpa konfirmasi."

msgid "Activate your PrasiBali.ai account"
msgstr "Aktifkan akun PrasiBali.ai Anda"

msgid "Confirm your email address"
msgstr "Konfirmasi alamat email Anda"

msgid "Sign in"
msgstr "Masuk"

msgid "Sign in to your account"
msgstr "Masuk ke akun Anda"

msgid ""
"Recognise characters, group their other names, and see whether they are "
"protagonists or antagonists."
msgstr ""
"Kenali tokoh, satukan nama lain, dan lihat peran protagonis atau antagonis "
"dari teks berbahasa Bali."

msgid "Create a new account"
msgstr "Buat akun baru"

msgid "Create account"
msgstr "Buat akun"

msgid ""
"We will send a link to your email. Open it to activate your account before "
"signing in."
msgstr ""
"Kami akan mengirim tautan ke email Anda. Buka tautan itu untuk mengaktifkan "
"akun sebelum masuk."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"I have read and agree to the <a class=\"link\" href=\"%(privacy_url)s\" "
"target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">privacy policy</a>."
msgstr ""
"Saya sudah membaca dan menyetujui <a class=\"link\" href=\"%(privacy_url)s\" "
"target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">kebijakan privasi</a>."

msgid "Already have an account?"
msgstr "Sudah punya akun?"

msgid "Account"
msgstr "Akun"

msgid "Email"
msgstr "Email"

msgid "Delete account"
msgstr "Hapus akun"

msgid ""
"Your account, profile, and analysis history will be deleted permanently. "
"Enter your password to confirm."
msgstr ""
"Akun, profil, dan riwayat analisis Anda akan dihapus permanen. Masukkan kata "
"sandi untuk mengonfirmasi."

msgid "Delete my account permanently"
msgstr "Hapus akun saya secara permanen"

msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Batal"

msgid "Save profile"
msgstr "Simpan profil"

msgid ""
"Deleting your account also deletes your analysis history. This cannot be "
"undone."
msgstr ""
"Menghapus akun juga menghapus riwayat analisis Anda. Tindakan ini tidak "
"dapat dibatalkan."

msgid "Prasi in Balinese script"
msgstr "Prasi dalam aksara Bali"

msgid "Analysis result"
msgstr "Hasil analisis"

msgid "Character groups"
msgstr "Kelompok tokoh"

msgid "Characters"
msgstr "Tokoh"

msgid "Protagonist"
msgstr "Protagonis"

msgid "Antagonist"
msgstr "Antagonis"

msgid "Story text"
msgstr "Teks cerita"

msgid "Entity label"
msgstr "Label entitas"

msgid "What do the labels mean?"
msgstr "Apa arti labelnya?"

msgid "a proper name, such as Made Bhaskara"
msgstr "nama diri, seperti Made Bhaskara"

msgid "an animal or object acting as a character, such as I Kancil"
msgstr "hewan atau benda yang dipersonifikasi, seperti I Kancil"

msgid "a god or holy figure, such as Bhatara Indra"
msgstr "dewa atau tokoh suci, seperti Bhatara Indra"

msgid "a name derived from a trait, such as I Belog"
msgstr "nama yang berasal dari sifat, seperti I Belog"

msgid "a reference without a proper name, such as memene"
msgstr "sebutan tanpa nama diri, seperti memene"

msgid "Solid underline: protagonist. Dashed underline: antagonist."
msgstr "Garis bawah utuh: protagonis. Garis bawah putus-putus: antagonis."

msgid "Also called"
msgstr "Disebut sebagai"

msgid "Mentions"
msgstr "Kemunculan"

msgid "Group"
msgstr "Kelompok"

msgid "Model score"
msgstr "Skor model"

msgid "Context words"
msgstr "Kata konteks"

#, python-format
msgid "%(n)s TF-IDF terms known"
msgstr "%(n)s term TF-IDF dikenal"

msgid ""
"Little context: this character appears in few sentences, so the label is "
"less reliable."
msgstr ""
"Konteks sedikit: tokoh ini muncul di sedikit kalimat, sehingga labelnya "
"kurang andal."

msgid "Characters found"
msgstr "Tokoh yang ditemukan"

msgid ""
"Role labels are an aid to analysis, not a final judgement. The models have "
"limited accuracy: the average F1 of every model in the thesis is below 0.70."
msgstr ""
"Label peran adalah alat bantu analisis, bukan kesimpulan akhir. Akurasi "
"model terbatas: F1 rata-rata semua model di tesis di bawah 0,70."

msgid ""
"The model score is the SVM decision_function: the signed distance to the "
"separating hyperplane, not a probability or confidence."
msgstr ""
"Skor model adalah decision_function SVM: jarak bertanda ke hyperplane "
"pemisah, bukan probabilitas atau tingkat keyakinan."

msgid "Models used"
msgstr "Model yang dipakai"

msgid "(i) Character identification"
msgstr "(i) Identifikasi tokoh"

msgid "CV F1"
msgstr "F1 CV"

msgid "test F1"
msgstr "F1 uji"

msgid "(ii) Alias clustering"
msgstr "(ii) Pengelompokan alias"

msgid "threshold"
msgstr "ambang"

msgid "(iii) Role classification"
msgstr "(iii) Klasifikasi peran"

msgid "Model file"
msgstr "Berkas model"

msgid "Word embedding (TF5)"
msgstr "Word embedding (TF5)"

msgid "dimensions"
msgstr "dimensi"

msgid "local file"
msgstr "berkas lokal"

msgid "Versions"
msgstr "Versi"

msgid "Duration"
msgstr "Durasi"

msgid "Satua analysis"
msgstr "Analisis satua"

msgid "Try a sample satua:"
msgstr "Coba contoh satua:"

msgid "Research mode: models and parameters"
msgstr "Mode Peneliti: model dan parameter"

msgid ""
"The defaults are the best configurations in the thesis. F1 values are the "
"thesis results for each experiment: cross-validation (CV) and test data."
msgstr ""
"Pilihan bawaan adalah konfigurasi terbaik menurut tesis. Nilai F1 adalah "
"hasil tesis untuk setiap eksperimen: cross-validation (CV) dan data uji."

msgid "Analysing..."
msgstr "Menganalisis..."

msgid "Analyse text"
msgstr "Analisis teks"

msgid "Up to 20,000 characters. Analysis usually takes a few seconds."
msgstr "Paling banyak 20.000 karakter. Analisis biasanya selesai dalam beberapa detik."

msgid "Try again"
msgstr "Coba lagi"

msgid "No analysis yet. Paste a satua text to begin."
msgstr "Belum ada analisis. Tempel teks satua untuk memulai."

msgid "Character analysis of Balinese satua"
msgstr "Analisis tokoh satua Bali"

msgid "Character analysis of Balinese satua in one workspace."
msgstr "Analisis tokoh satua Bali dalam satu ruang kerja."

msgid ""
"Recognise characters, group their other names, and see whether they are "
"protagonists or antagonists in a text written in Balinese."
msgstr ""
"Kenali tokoh, satukan nama lain, dan lihat peran protagonis atau antagonis "
"dari teks berbahasa Bali."

msgid "Example of how results are shown"
msgstr "Contoh tampilan hasil"

msgid "Welcome back"
msgstr "Selamat datang kembali"

#, python-format
msgid "You are signed in as %(name)s."
msgstr "Anda masuk sebagai %(name)s."

msgid "Continue to the workspace"
msgstr "Lanjutkan ke ruang kerja"

msgid "Forgot your password?"
msgstr "Lupa kata sandi?"

msgid "What PrasiBali.ai does"
msgstr "Yang dilakukan PrasiBali.ai"

msgid "Recognise characters"
msgstr "Kenali tokoh"

msgid ""
"SatuaNER finds the names of characters in the story: people, animals, gods "
"and objects that act like characters."
msgstr ""
"SatuaNER menemukan nama tokoh dalam cerita: manusia, hewan, dewa, dan benda "
"yang berperan sebagai tokoh."

msgid "Group other names"
msgstr "Satukan nama lain"

msgid ""
"Different names for the same character, such as I Kancil and Kancil, are "
"combined into one character group."
msgstr ""
"Sebutan berbeda untuk tokoh yang sama, seperti I Kancil dan Kancil, digabung "
"menjadi satu kelompok tokoh."

msgid "See their roles"
msgstr "Lihat perannya"

msgid ""
"A model trained in the thesis research labels each character group as "
"protagonist or antagonist, as an aid to analysis."
msgstr ""
"Model hasil penelitian tesis memberi label protagonis atau antagonis pada "
"setiap kelompok tokoh, sebagai alat bantu analisis."

msgid "Privacy policy"
msgstr "Kebijakan privasi"

#, python-format
msgid "Version %(version)s"
msgstr "Versi %(version)s"

msgid "Data we store"
msgstr "Data yang kami simpan"

msgid ""
"Your account: email address, full name, institution (optional), role, "
"preferred interface language, and the time you agreed to this policy."
msgstr ""
"Akun Anda: alamat email, nama lengkap, institusi (opsional), peran, bahasa "
"antarmuka pilihan, dan waktu Anda menyetujui kebijakan ini."

msgid ""
"Your analyses: the satua texts you submit, the analysis results, and the "
"model settings used, so that you can open them again in your history."
msgstr ""
"Analisis Anda: teks satua yang Anda kirim, hasil analisis, dan pengaturan "
"model yang dipakai, agar dapat dibuka lagi di riwayat."

msgid "How your texts are processed"
msgstr "Cara teks Anda diproses"

msgid ""
"All AI models run on the PrasiBali.ai server. Your texts are not sent to "
"third-party AI services."
msgstr ""
"Semua model AI berjalan di server PrasiBali.ai. Teks Anda tidak dikirim ke "
"layanan AI pihak ketiga."

msgid "What we use the data for"
msgstr "Kegunaan data"

msgid ""
"To sign you in, verify your email address, reset your password, apply the "
"daily analysis quota, and show your analysis history. We do not sell or "
"share your data."
msgstr ""
"Untuk proses masuk, verifikasi email, reset kata sandi, kuota analisis "
"harian, dan menampilkan riwayat analisis Anda. Kami tidak menjual atau "
"membagikan data Anda."

msgid ""
"Verification and password reset emails are sent through an email delivery "
"service (Gmail SMTP)."
msgstr ""
"Email verifikasi dan reset kata sandi dikirim melalui layanan pengiriman "
"email (SMTP Gmail)."

msgid "Cookies and browser storage"
msgstr "Cookie dan penyimpanan browser"

msgid ""
"We use only the cookies needed to keep you signed in, protect forms, and "
"remember your language. Your theme choice is stored in your browser. There "
"are no tracking or advertising cookies."
msgstr ""
"Kami hanya memakai cookie yang diperlukan agar Anda tetap masuk, melindungi "
"formulir, dan mengingat bahasa Anda. Pilihan tema disimpan di browser Anda. "
"Tidak ada cookie pelacak atau iklan."

msgid "Your control over your data"
msgstr "Kendali Anda atas data"

msgid ""
"You can delete individual analyses or your whole history. You can delete "
"your account from the profile page; this permanently deletes your account "
"and all of your analyses."
msgstr ""
"Anda dapat menghapus analisis satu per satu atau seluruh riwayat. Akun dapat "
"dihapus dari halaman profil; tindakan ini menghapus akun beserta semua "
"analisis Anda secara permanen."

msgid "Display mode"
msgstr "Mode tampilan"

msgid "Advanced (research mode)"
msgstr "Lanjutan (Mode Peneliti)"

msgid "PrasiBali.ai home"
msgstr "Beranda PrasiBali.ai"

msgid "Site"
msgstr "Situs"

msgid "Analysis"
msgstr "Analisis"

msgid "Sign out"
msgstr "Keluar"

msgid "Sign up"
msgstr "Daftar"

msgid "Dark theme"
msgstr "Tema gelap"

msgid "Light theme"
msgstr "Tema terang"
